message: "If you use EvoNAS or cite Phase 12A results, please cite this software record and the experimental protocol."
type: software
title: "EvoNAS: Evolutionary Neural Architecture Search Platform"
version: "1.0.0rc2"
date-released: "2026-07-31"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CoderAnush/EvoNAS"
license: "MIT"
authors:
  - family-names: "[PLACEHOLDER]"
