    affiliation: "[PLACEHOLDER]"
abstract: >-
  EvoNAS is a Clean-Architecture AutoML/NAS platform with Self-Adaptive PSO,
  closed-loop governance, and a fair research benchmarking layer. Phase 12A
  provides multi-seed Sphere/Rastrigin comparisons of Standard PSO, SAPSO,
  and Random Search on frozen v1.0.0-rc2.
keywords:
  - neural architecture search
  - particle swarm optimization
  - self-adaptive PSO
  - AutoML
  - reproducibility
